        "accession_number": "0001647639-26-000027",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a result, we can develop our business and our AI models faster than if we relied only on the funding capacity of our lending partners.",
        "start_character": 14422,
        "end_character": 14559
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001647639-26-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001647639-26-000027-8acfa87acccdd145",
        "accession_number": "0001647639-26-000027",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As of December 31, 2025, this model was trained on nearly 104 million repayment events, and it is only one of approximately 30 proprietary machine learning models that we developed in-house, which we use across our business.",
        "start_character": 6009,
        "end_character": 6233
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001647639-26-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001647639-26-000027-8acfa87acccdd145",
        "accession_number": "0001647639-26-000027",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For example, to ensure proper controls are in place to maintain compliance with the consumer protection related laws and regulations, we have developed a compliance management system consistent with the regulatory expectations published by governmental agencies.",
        "start_character": 45230,
        "end_character": 45492
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001647639-26-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001647639-26-000027-8acfa87acccdd145",
        "accession_number": "0001647639-26-000027",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For example, we believe our machine learning team, responsible for the development and constant improvement of our AI models, is unlike any other that we are aware of in the consumer lending space.",
        "start_character": 48462,
        "end_character": 48659
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001647639-26-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001647639-26-000027-8acfa87acccdd145",
        "accession_number": "0001647639-26-000027",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For our asset-backed securitizations, we engage with investment banks to structure transactions under which we and/or certain of the purchasers of whole loans or pass-through certificates sell pools of whole loans to a bankruptcy-remote special purpose entity.",
        "start_character": 16035,
        "end_character": 16295
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001647639-26-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001647639-26-000027-8acfa87acccdd145",
        "accession_number": "0001647639-26-000027",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "From our compensation practices to how we think about talent management and team development to the perks and benefits we invest in, each decision we make and every strategy we build is considered with the lens of ensuring we create a culture that inspires the best work from all employees, and recognizes results fairly and equitably for everyone.",
        "start_character": 49065,
        "end_character": 49413
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001647639-26-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001647639-26-000027-8acfa87acccdd145",
        "accession_number": "0001647639-26-000027",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In order to support innovation in our models, we have developed proprietary technologies to enable our machine learning team to develop, train, test and deploy new model updates with minimal engineering support.",
        "start_character": 22241,
        "end_character": 22452
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001647639-26-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001647639-26-000027-8acfa87acccdd145",
        "accession_number": "0001647639-26-000027",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have a robust secure software development cycle and regularly engage with third parties to audit our security program and to perform regular penetration tests of our Web application and cloud environment.",
        "start_character": 21538,
        "end_character": 21745
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001647639-26-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001647639-26-000027-8acfa87acccdd145",
        "accession_number": "0001647639-26-000027",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have developed sophisticated tools that our internal operations team uses to support the origination and servicing of credit.",
        "start_character": 25551,
        "end_character": 25679
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001647639-26-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001647639-26-000027-8acfa87acccdd145",
        "accession_number": "0001647639-26-000027",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "While no compliance program can assure that there will not be violations, or alleged violations, of applicable laws, we believe that our compliance management system is reasonably designed and managed to minimize compliance-related risks.",
        "start_character": 45493,
        "end_character": 45731
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001647639-26-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001647639-26-000027-8acfa87acccdd145",
        "accession_number": "0001647639-26-000027",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "While verification is primarily and increasingly handled by our software and AI models, we also offer Upstart-designed tools to guide credit analysts and fraud specialists in cases where our software is not yet able to sufficiently verify borrower information.",
        "start_character": 25969,
        "end_character": 26229
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001647639-26-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001647639-26-000027-8acfa87acccdd145",
        "accession_number": "0001647639-26-000027",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "•Flexible configurations—We built a configurable lending solution designed to meet the needs of our lending partners.",
        "start_character": 17109,
        "end_character": 17226
      }
    ]
